.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH stool-apple-brew 1  "stool-apple-brew "
.SH NAME
stool\-apple\-brew \- Initialize Homebrew and install software from a Brewfile
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-apple\-brew\fR [\fB\-\-prefix\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Initialize Homebrew and install software from a Brewfile
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-prefix\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Select a Homebrew prefix instead of HOMEBREW_PREFIX, PATH or the native default
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
stool\-apple\-brew\-init(1)
Reuse Homebrew or install it with the official installer
.TP
stool\-apple\-brew\-install(1)
Ensure Homebrew is available, then install a trusted Brewfile without routine upgrades
.TP
stool\-apple\-brew\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
